### Variables
@port = 3000
@baseUrl = http://localhost:{{port}}/api

### GET All Games
GET {{baseUrl}}/games
Accept: application/json

### POST a New Game
POST {{baseUrl}}/games
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Zombies Ate My Neighbors",
    "platform": "SNES",
    "releaseYear": 1996,
    "isComplete": true
}

### POST another Game (Different Platform)
POST {{baseUrl}}/games
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Sonic the Hedgehog",
    "platform": "Sega Genesis",
    "releaseYear": 1991,
    "isComplete": false
}

### GET Unique Platforms
GET {{baseUrl}}/platforms

### SEARCH by Platform
GET {{baseUrl}}/games/search?platform=SNES

### DELETE a Game
# Replace '1' with an actual ID from your GET request
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/games/1